%%{init: {'theme':'neutral'}}%%
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Waiting
    Waiting --> Playing : segment dequeued
    Playing --> Waiting : afplay finishes<br/>and more segments expected
    Playing --> Draining : afplay finishes<br/>and SENTINEL seen
    Waiting --> Draining : SENTINEL seen<br/>queue empty
    Draining --> Done : last afplay returns 0
    Playing --> Error : afplay nonzero exit
    Waiting --> Error : stop_event set
    Error --> [*]
    Done --> [*]
